  "body": "## What's new in 2.1.0\r\n\r\n**Mail server settings can now be changed in the app.**\r\nAdmin \u2192 Email and Printer \u2192 Change Email Account now has a collapsed\r\n\"Mail server settings (advanced)\" section with Server, Port and Security\r\n(STARTTLS, SSL/TLS or None). The defaults are still Gmail\r\n(smtp.gmail.com, port 587, STARTTLS), and existing setups keep working\r\nwith no changes. Only change these if you've been told to.\r\n\r\n- Connection errors now name the server the app tried to reach.\r\n- Switching mail servers no longer carries old connection settings over to the new one.\r\n\r\n## Upgrading\r\n\r\nReplace the old jar with `package-manager-2.1.0-jar-with-dependencies.jar`.\r\nYour settings and student data carry over.\r\n\r\nIf you're upgrading from a version **before 2.0.0**, read the\r\n[2.0.0 release notes](https://github.com/ravnx/Jones-PMS/releases/tag/v2.0.0) first.\r\n2.0.0 changed the student file format, and older versions can't read it after\r\nthe upgrade. A backup is saved in `backups/` when the program starts."
